  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T M.3071 introduces a new network management functional architecture with cloud-computing technology. In this Recommendation, the background and basic concept of cloud-based network management are provided. This Recommendation also provides details of a cloud-based network management functional architecture, including its basic components, functionalities and the relationship between its components.</abstract>
